customer: young_entrepreneur
problem: gpu_overheating
brief:
	The deletion event. A Win95 [x] floats over him all of day 6, also when he picks up, and only that day: the one exception to the [x] being for regular customers only. A click deletes him: he and his computer vanish (also from the counter) and are never mentioned again, except at the end. His voice glitches with Cambion.
